                    "maxclass": "comment",
                    "numinlets": 1,
                    "numoutlets": 0,
                    "patching_rect": [ 20.0, 96.0, 507.0, 74.0 ],
                    "text": "An expression assert normally passes on the first true. With @every 1 it must be true on every call, up to @maxCalls, which turns a list of cases into one parameterised test. Feed the rows with ordinary Max objects: here a message box of comma-separated pairs and [unpack].\n\n@tolerance lets a number of rows fail without failing the assert."
                }
            },
            {
                "box": {
                    "id": "obj-3",
                    "maxclass": "newobj",
                    "numinlets": 0,
                    "numoutlets": 1,
